'''The Devils' Academy''' (学園に巣くう悪意, ''Gakuen ni Sukū Akui'', '''Malice in the Academy''') is the 20th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]] and the 69th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
An extremely road-blocking chapter before [[Urs & Fenrir (Enemy)|Urs & Fenrir]]. [[Lonely Goldfish]] in particular is quite tough if you cannot time properly. The rest while not as difficult, shouldn't be underestimated.
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

